        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b70idrmCSF3jJlE7nc7l-62" value="&lt;h3&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Flow Description:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; start=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Start:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;User send create Transaction&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Forward Request&lt;/b&gt;: The &lt;code&gt;API Gateway&lt;/code&gt; forwards the request to the &lt;code&gt;Transaction Manager&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure Point:&lt;/b&gt; The &lt;code&gt;Transaction Manager&lt;/code&gt; calls the &lt;code&gt;Inventory Manager&lt;/code&gt; but the request is immediately rejected due to a business rule (e.g., &lt;b&gt;stock is zero&lt;/b&gt;) or a system error (service unavailable).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;No Compensation:&lt;/b&gt; No compensating action is initiated because no state change occurred prior to the failure.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reporting:&lt;/b&gt; The &lt;code&gt;Transaction Manager&lt;/code&gt; reports the error (e.g., &lt;code&gt;400 Bad Request&lt;/code&gt;) back to the &lt;code&gt;API Gateway&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;End:&lt;/b&gt; The &lt;code style=&quot;&quot;&gt;API Gateway&lt;/code&gt; sends the error response to the &lt;code style=&quot;&quot;&gt;User&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="425" y="1075" width="1460" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
